{"id":"22b17db5c9bdf92d","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-model8-approximation-property.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Approximation Property","display":"df-zfc-model8-approximation-property — ZFC Model8 Approximation Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-approximation-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-approximation-property","58-df-zfc-model9-approximation-property"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-approximation-property — ZFC Model8 Approximation Property","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-transitive]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-bijective]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-approximation-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-approximation-property</span><span>58-df-zfc-model9-approximation-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-approximation-property — ZFC Model8 Approximation Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"58-df-transitive\">58-df-transitive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(M,N,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (transitive set models and approximation bound), with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in M\">\\(\\kappa\\in M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq M\">\\(A\\subseteq M\\)</span> (approximated subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in M\">\\(a\\in M\\)</span> (small approximation domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Bijective},\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Bijective},\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span> (source predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> (ambient set-theory axiom set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{MCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\)</span> (&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is a cardinal as computed in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>&quot;, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MSmall}_S(a,\\kappa,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{MSmall}_S(a,\\kappa,M)\\)</span> (&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> contains an injection of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> into an ordinal below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>&quot;, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8ApproximationProperty}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8ApproximationProperty}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in N\">\\(X\\in N\\)</span> (merged approximated subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ApproximationProperty}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9ApproximationProperty}_S\\)</span> (merged predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}internal\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{MCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists g\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(g,\\kappa,\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}internal\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{MCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists g\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(g,\\kappa,\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}internal\\text{-}small} \\vdash \\mathrm{MSmall}_S(a,\\kappa,M)\\leftrightarrow a\\in M\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(g,a,\\alpha)\\land\\forall x,y\\in a\\;(g(x)=g(y)\\to x=y)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}internal\\text{-}small} \\vdash \\mathrm{MSmall}_S(a,\\kappa,M)\\leftrightarrow a\\in M\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(g,a,\\alpha)\\land\\forall x,y\\in a\\;(g(x)=g(y)\\to x=y)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}approximation\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8ApproximationProperty}_S(N,M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\\land M\\subseteq N\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\langle M,\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\langle N,\\in\\cap(N\\times N)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\land\\mathrm{MCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\land\\forall A\\in N\\;\\Bigl((A\\subseteq M\\land\\forall a\\in M\\;(\\mathrm{MSmall}_S(a,\\kappa,M)\\to A\\cap a\\in M))\\to A\\in M\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}approximation\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8ApproximationProperty}_S(N,M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\\land M\\subseteq N\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\langle M,\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\langle N,\\in\\cap(N\\times N)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\land\\mathrm{MCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\land\\forall A\\in N\\;\\Bigl((A\\subseteq M\\land\\forall a\\in M\\;(\\mathrm{MSmall}_S(a,\\kappa,M)\\to A\\cap a\\in M))\\to A\\in M\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}approximation\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9ApproximationProperty}_S(M,N,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcModel8ApproximationProperty}_S(N,M,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}approximation\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9ApproximationProperty}_S(M,N,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcModel8ApproximationProperty}_S(N,M,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Internal cardinality is expressed by set-coded bijections and injections belonging to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>; raw modal notation and the undefined term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|a|^M\">\\(|a|^M\\)</span> are not used.</li>\n<li>The ZFC requirements are routed through the sourced two-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span> predicate on explicit membership structures.</li>\n<li>The model9 argument order is retained only as a legacy alias.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mat